# #5833. A PreArm append has no leaf-entry check, and here it skips the routing
# generation check too: a purged incarnation's straddler appended under the PreArm
# class is allocated above L's recorded close.
MODULE: StraddlerBelowInitPreArmSkipsGeneration
TARGET: StraddlerBelowInit
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a PreArm append is admitted without its routing generation check
PERTURBS: PreArmAlloc

--- FIND
    /\ fo[i] => pstamp[i] > loaded[i]
    /\ loaded[i] # Unloaded
    /\ pstamp[i] >= loaded[i]
    /\ next < MaxOff
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no routing generation check.
    /\ next < MaxOff
--- END
